{"unit_id":"YupegLV__dsh-chat-log#card-zh","repo":"YupegLV/dsh-chat-log","commit":"d4e550119f467b9fc4b12ec4dec62d6df2b5f6d3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-log 是面向 DSH Web 的会话记录导出插件，可把会话整理成可读的嵌套聊天 JSON。它提供 /chat 命令，并在会话页眉添加 Chat log 下载按钮。插件以权威消息折叠流式文本、推理和工具调用片段，生成 dsh-chat.v1 格式的轮次、步骤与工具结果，同时保留其他事件并提供片段核对报告。可指定会话 ID 和输出目录，也可从浏览器下载。适合需要归档、阅读或处理 DSH 会话记录的用户；需要 DSH Web 的会话服务及 Node.js 22.15 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:90-123","lib/fold.js:74-82","lib/fold.js:241-268","lib/client.js:39-89"]}
{"unit_id":"YupegLV__dsh-chat-log#card-en","repo":"YupegLV/dsh-chat-log","commit":"d4e550119f467b9fc4b12ec4dec62d6df2b5f6d3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chat-log exports DSH Web session logs as nested chat JSON through /chat or a session header button. It organizes messages into turns, steps, and tool results, retains other events, and compares stream fragments with authoritative messages. Requires DSH session services and Node.js 22.15+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:90-123","lib/fold.js:74-82","lib/fold.js:241-268","lib/client.js:39-89"]}
